## Windows TSF Text Store (IME)

The Windows Text Services Framework integration
(crates/rikka-terminal-gpui-ime — the ITextStoreACP text store, thread-manager
activation, and document/context focus that let the taskbar input indicator
track our windows) is adapted from the arcweft project's app-side TSF text
input.

